{"availability":"available","full":"ndegheselle/Joufflu","name":"Joufflu","description":"WPF inputs and components","category":"Other","language":"C#","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2024-01-12T19:42:03Z","updated":"2026-10-07T10:27:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ndegheselle.github.io/Joufflu/","topics":["controls","themes","ui","wpf"],"demo":"https://ndegheselle.github.io/Joufflu/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.064Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.064Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.064Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.064Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern WPF component library that makes your desktop apps look good by default.","Joufflu gives .NET WPF apps a cohesive set of inputs and reusable controls built on a design system of themed brushes, dimensions and layout helpers. Every control reads its colours through DynamicResource, so the whole UI re-themes live between Light and Dark — no restart, no flicker."],"features":["🌗 Live Light / Dark theming — flip the theme at runtime and every control follows instantly.","🎨 A real design system — semantic colours, dimensions, sizing and spacing exposed as override-able resource keys.","🧩 Ready-to-use inputs — numeric, decimal and timespan pickers, searchable and tag combo boxes, file and colour pickers, inline-editable text, dropdowns.","🧭 Navigation & overlays — a navigation menu, a view-model-first page container and awaitable modal dialogs.","🗂️ A file explorer — breadcrumb, folder tree and file list sharing a source, with shell-backed file operations and nodes of your own."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ndegheselle/Joufflu/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"379612b1f7c640b83525b9662035a4f1d6b729f01047cf29ee0dbc6e5feb9925","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.283Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:19.283Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":